<title>FRANCE: Suez Lyonnaise sees 250 mln ffr in savings.</title>
<headline>Suez Lyonnaise sees 250 mln ffr in savings.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The merger between Lyonnaise des Eaux and Cie de Suez will save some 250 million francs in a full year on overhead costs, Lyonnaise chairman Jerome Monod said on friday.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be savings estimated at 250 million francs in a full year&quot; he told journalists, adding there would also be a goodwill write-down of 250 million francs.</p>
<p>He said the new group would have a single headquarters.</p>
</text>
